(text "CM5. GPIO map: 0/1 ID_SD/SC -> header A I2C; 2/3 display I2C (DSI83 + touch); 4 TOUCH_INT_N; 5 TOUCH_RST_N; 6 DSI83_EN; 7 DSI83_IRQ;\n8-11 SPI0 to MCU (33R series); 12 BL_PWM; 13 BTN_BL_PWM (button backlight dimming, PWM0_CHAN1); 14/15 UART0 to MCU; 16 PANEL_VDD_EN; 17 TOUCH_PWR_EN; 18-21 SPI1 header A;\n22 CM5_NRST; 23 SWCLK; 24 SWDIO; 25 MCU_IRQ; 26 MODEM_PWR_EN; 27 CM5_BOOT0." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fcb2189a-17a9-40c7-9ac6-ff1ba01d14c6"))
)
